            <div class="chat-area" id="chatArea">
                <div class="message bot-msg">
                    <div class="bubble bot-bubble">
                        👋 <strong>Supreme Problem Detector v7.0</strong><br><br>
                        ✅ <strong>V4:</strong> Trust Score System (CORE)<br>
                        ✅ <strong>V5:</strong> FREE Rule + Final Output<br>
                        ✅ <strong>V6:</strong> Dashboard Flow + Problem Detection<br>
